---
// Struct layout + struct tags + value vs pointer receivers + composition via struct embedding.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf2c">
  <div class="gf2c-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Go struct design showing fields with JSON tags, value versus pointer method receivers, and composition through struct embedding.">
      {/* Left panel: Value vs Pointer receiver */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="424" height="254" rx="10" class="gf2c-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf2c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Structs &amp; Choosing Method Receivers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Struct &amp; cách chọn Value vs. Pointer Receiver</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="392" height="58" rx="6" class="gf2c-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf2c-b">func (a Account) Balance() int  // Value Receiver</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Receives a read-only copy; works on both Account and *Account.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhận bản sao chỉ đọc; gọi được từ cả giá trị lẫn con trỏ.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="128" width="392" height="62" rx="6" class="gf2c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="148" class="gf2c-b-ok">func (a *Account) Deposit(n int)  // Pointer Receiver</text>
      <text x="44" y="167" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Use when mutating fields, holding Mutex, or struct is big.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng khi sửa dữ liệu, chứa sync.Mutex hoặc struct nhiều field.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="200" width="392" height="52" rx="6" class="gf2c-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="220" class="gf2c-b-red">Rule: Keep receivers consistent across all methods of T</text>
      <text x="44" y="238" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Pointer methods stay absent from plain value T's method set!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Method (*T) KHÔNG nằm trong tập hàm của giá trị T thuần.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Struct Composition */}
      <rect x="458" y="14" width="428" height="254" rx="10" class="gf2c-card" />
      <text x="474" y="42" class="gf2c-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Composition Over Inheritance (Embedding)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Kế thừa kiểu Go: Nhúng Struct (Embedding)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="60" width="396" height="72" rx="6" class="gf2c-box is-ok" />
      <text x="488" y="80" class="gf2c-b-ok">type Server struct {'{'} Logger; Addr string `json:"addr"` {'}'}</text>
      <text x="488" y="100" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Anonymous field promotes Logger.Info() → call s.Info() directly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhúng ẩn Logger → gọi thẳng được s.Info("up") từ bên ngoài.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="118" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Struct tags (`json:"addr"`) stay metadata only for reflection.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Struct tag chỉ là nhãn metadata cho encoder đọc lúc runtime.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="474" y="144" width="396" height="108" rx="6" class="gf2c-box" />
      <text x="488" y="166" class="gf2c-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Important distinction from OOP inheritance:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khác biệt sống còn so với kế thừa Class (OOP):</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="186" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Server is NOT a Logger subclass ("has-a", never "is-a").</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Embedding là "chứa bên trong" (has-a), KHÔNG phải "là một" (is-a).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="205" class="gf2c-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Outer methods forward inner state without fragile vtable hierarchies.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Loại bỏ hoàn toàn cây kế thừa nhiều tầng khó bảo trì khi code lớn.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="488" y="226" class="gf2c-b-ok">Go sugar: x.Deposit() auto-takes (&amp;x) for addressable vars.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Attach pointer receivers whenever a method modifies fields (or guards state with a Mutex), keep receiver kinds consistent per type, and reuse behavior cleanly via struct embedding.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Chọn pointer receiver (*T) khi hàm cần sửa dữ liệu hoặc chứa Mutex, giữ đồng nhất kiểu receiver trên cùng struct, và dùng struct embedding để tái sử dụng hành vi thay cho kế thừa class.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf2c { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf2c-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf2c svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf2c text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf2c-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf2c-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf2c-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf2c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2c-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2c-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2c-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf2c-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf2c-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf2c-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf2c-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf2c figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
